    "title": "UPDATE: Child, adult driving tractor severely injured in north Christian County crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christian County Now ,\n1 days ago Updated 8:39 p.m. A 6-year-old girl and an adult man were flown to Nashville, Tennessee after their tractor was hit by a truck Wednesday night in Crofton. The man suffered from significant head trauma and facial fractures, according to Payton Rodgers with Hopkinsville Fire/EMS. He was flown via helicopter to Skyline Medical Center. The child also had head trauma and facial injuries and was flown to Vanderbilt Pediatrics. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 10",
